========================================
SERVICE: TABLE BOOKING SERVICE
========================================

PURPOSE:
Allows users to reserve tables in bakery for specific time slots.

----------------------------------------
CORE RESPONSIBILITIES:
----------------------------------------
- Book table
- Prevent double booking
- Manage time slots
- Handle concurrent requests

----------------------------------------
DATABASE:
----------------------------------------

TABLE: table_booking
- id
- user_id
- table_number
- slot_time
- status

----------------------------------------
SUMMARY:
----------------------------------------
Ensures only one user can book a table per time slot using locks.